{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55403","headline":"十玄谈（幷序） 转位归（《大正》本、《偈颂》作「回机」） · 常察","name":"十玄谈（幷序） 转位归（《大正》本、《偈颂》作「回机」）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"湼盘城里尚犹危，陌路相逢没了（《大正》本作「没定」、《偈颂》作「勿定」）期。\n权挂垢衣云是佛，却装珍御复名谁？木人夜半穿靴去，石女天明戴帽归。\n万古碧潭空界月，再三涝（《大正》本、《偈颂》作「捞」）漉始应知。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"常察","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55403.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55403","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}